### ============================================================
### TENANTS — CADASTRO
### Requer SystemAdmin
### ============================================================

### Tenants - Cadastrar empresa
POST {{WorkFlow_API_HostAddress}}/api/tenants
Authorization: Bearer {{systemAdminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "name": "Empresa Teste HTTP",
  "registrationNumber": "REG-API-CRIACAO-001",
  "email": "empresa-api@test.local",
  "phone": "(47) 99999-9999"
}


### Tenants - Cadastrar empresa com nome vazio - deve retornar 400 Bad Request
POST {{WorkFlow_API_HostAddress}}/api/tenants
Authorization: Bearer {{systemAdminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "name": " ",
  "registrationNumber": "REG-INVALIDO-001",
  "email": "invalida@test.local"
}


### ============================================================
### TENANTS — CONSULTA INDIVIDUAL
### Requer SystemAdmin
### ============================================================

### Tenants - Consultar Tenant secundário
GET {{WorkFlow_API_HostAddress}}/api/tenants/{{tenantSecundarioPublicId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{systemAdminToken}}
Accept: application/json


### Tenants - Consultar empresa inexistente - deve retornar 404 Not Found
GET {{WorkFlow_API_HostAddress}}/api/tenants/11111111-1111-1111-1111-111111111111
Authorization: Bearer {{systemAdminToken}}
Accept: application/json


### ============================================================
### TENANTS — ALTERAÇÃO DE STATUS
### Requer SystemAdmin
### ============================================================

### Tenants - Desativar Tenant secundário
PATCH {{WorkFlow_API_HostAddress}}/api/tenants/{{tenantSecundarioPublicId}}/status
Authorization: Bearer {{systemAdminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "isActive": false
}


### Tenants - Consultar Tenant secundário desativado
GET {{WorkFlow_API_HostAddress}}/api/tenants/{{tenantSecundarioPublicId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{systemAdminToken}}
Accept: application/json


### Tenants - Reativar Tenant secundário
PATCH {{WorkFlow_API_HostAddress}}/api/tenants/{{tenantSecundarioPublicId}}/status
Authorization: Bearer {{systemAdminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "isActive": true
}


### Tenants - Alterar status de empresa inexistente - deve retornar 404 Not Found
PATCH {{WorkFlow_API_HostAddress}}/api/tenants/aaaaaaaa-aaaa-aaaa-aaaa-aaaaaaaaaaaa/status
Authorization: Bearer {{systemAdminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "isActive": false
}


### Tenants - Alterar status com PublicId vazio - deve retornar 400 Bad Request
PATCH {{WorkFlow_API_HostAddress}}/api/tenants/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000/status
Authorization: Bearer {{systemAdminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "isActive": false
}


### ============================================================
### TENANTS — ATUALIZAÇÃO
### Requer SystemAdmin
### ============================================================

### Tenants - Atualizar Tenant secundário
PUT {{WorkFlow_API_HostAddress}}/api/tenants/{{tenantSecundarioPublicId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{systemAdminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "name": "Empresa Testes Atualizada",
  "email": "empresa-atualizada@test.local",
  "phone": "(47) 98888-7777"
}


### Tenants - Consultar Tenant secundário após atualização
GET {{WorkFlow_API_HostAddress}}/api/tenants/{{tenantSecundarioPublicId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{systemAdminToken}}
Accept: application/json


### Tenants - Atualizar empresa inexistente - deve retornar 404 Not Found
PUT {{WorkFlow_API_HostAddress}}/api/tenants/aaaaaaaa-aaaa-aaaa-aaaa-aaaaaaaaaaaa
Authorization: Bearer {{systemAdminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "name": "Empresa Inexistente",
  "email": "inexistente@test.local",
  "phone": null
}


### Tenants - Atualizar empresa com nome vazio - deve retornar 400 Bad Request
PUT {{WorkFlow_API_HostAddress}}/api/tenants/{{tenantSecundarioPublicId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{systemAdminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "name": "   ",
  "email": "empresa-atualizada@test.local",
  "phone": "(47) 98888-7777"
}


### Tenants - Atualizar empresa com e-mail vazio - deve retornar 400 Bad Request
PUT {{WorkFlow_API_HostAddress}}/api/tenants/{{tenantSecundarioPublicId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{systemAdminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "name": "Empresa Testes Atualizada",
  "email": "   ",
  "phone": "(47) 98888-7777"
}


### Tenants - Remover telefone da empresa
PUT {{WorkFlow_API_HostAddress}}/api/tenants/{{tenantSecundarioPublicId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{systemAdminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "name": "Empresa Testes Atualizada",
  "email": "empresa-atualizada@test.local",
  "phone": null
}


### Tenants - Confirmar remoção do telefone
GET {{WorkFlow_API_HostAddress}}/api/tenants/{{tenantSecundarioPublicId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{systemAdminToken}}
Accept: application/json


### ============================================================
### TENANTS — LISTAGEM
### Requer SystemAdmin
### ============================================================

### Tenants - Listar empresas com paginação padrão
GET {{WorkFlow_API_HostAddress}}/api/tenants
Authorization: Bearer {{systemAdminToken}}
Accept: application/json


### Tenants - Listar segunda página de empresas
GET {{WorkFlow_API_HostAddress}}/api/tenants?pageNumber=2&pageSize=2
Authorization: Bearer {{systemAdminToken}}
Accept: application/json


### Tenants - Pesquisar empresa pelo nome
GET {{WorkFlow_API_HostAddress}}/api/tenants?search=atualizada
Authorization: Bearer {{systemAdminToken}}
Accept: application/json


### Tenants - Listar somente empresas inativas
GET {{WorkFlow_API_HostAddress}}/api/tenants?isActive=false
Authorization: Bearer {{systemAdminToken}}
Accept: application/json


### Tenants - Listar empresas com número de página inválido - deve retornar 400 Bad Request
GET {{WorkFlow_API_HostAddress}}/api/tenants?pageNumber=0&pageSize=20
Authorization: Bearer {{systemAdminToken}}
Accept: application/json


### Tenants - Listar empresas com tamanho de página acima do limite - deve retornar 400 Bad Request
GET {{WorkFlow_API_HostAddress}}/api/tenants?pageNumber=1&pageSize=101
Authorization: Bearer {{systemAdminToken}}
Accept: application/json


### ============================================================
### TENANTS — AUTORIZAÇÃO
### Endpoints administrativos são exclusivos de SystemAdmin
### ============================================================

### Tenants - Listar sem token - deve retornar 401 Unauthorized
GET {{WorkFlow_API_HostAddress}}/api/tenants
Accept: application/json


### Tenants - Listar como Member - deve retornar 403 Forbidden
GET {{WorkFlow_API_HostAddress}}/api/tenants
Authorization: Bearer {{memberToken}}
Accept: application/json


### Tenants - Listar como SystemAdmin - deve retornar 200 OK
GET {{WorkFlow_API_HostAddress}}/api/tenants
Authorization: Bearer {{systemAdminToken}}
Accept: application/json


### ============================================================
### TENANTS — APOIO PARA TESTES DE OUTROS MÓDULOS
###
### ATENÇÃO:
### Estas requisições alteram o estado do Tenant principal.
### Sempre execute a reativação depois do teste correspondente.
### ============================================================

### Tenants - Desativar Tenant principal para testar operações com Tenant inativo
PATCH {{WorkFlow_API_HostAddress}}/api/tenants/{{tenantPrincipalPublicId}}/status
Authorization: Bearer {{systemAdminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "isActive": false
}


### Tenants - Reativar Tenant principal após testes com Tenant inativo
PATCH {{WorkFlow_API_HostAddress}}/api/tenants/{{tenantPrincipalPublicId}}/status
Authorization: Bearer {{systemAdminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "isActive": true
}